  "changelog": "geoskill-spatial-data-validation v1.0.0\n\n- Initial release providing four-dimensional vector data quality validation: geometry validity, topology checks, attribute completeness, and CRS consistency.\n- Generates a composite quality score (A\u2013F grade) using weighted results from each validation dimension.\n- Exports invalid geometry features as GeoJSON for manual review.\n- Supports \"synthetic\" mode to generate test datasets containing intentional defects for offline QA testing.\n- Outputs detailed quality reports and manifest files in JSON format.\n- Fully local and offline operation, with all processing done on the user's machine.",
